      "chunk_id": "text_2",
      "quote": "The aim of this study is to identify high-risk phenotypes of diabetes associated with COVID-19 severity and death.",
      "reason": "The manuscript gives an explicit statement of the objective of the review (to identify high‑risk diabetes phenotypes associated with COVID‑19 severity and death)."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_4_e2",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": "text_2",
      "quote": "This is the first edition of a living systematic review and meta-analysis on observational studies investigating phenotypes in individuals with diabetes and COVID-19-related death and severity.",
      "reason": "The conditional item applies to reviews of intervention effects (PICO); this review synthesises observational studies of phenotypes, not intervention comparisons, so PICO-style planned comparisons are not applicable."
    }
  ],
  "confidence": 90
